.SH BUGS

Too many messages are being sent to notify a QLT that a frame has changed.
This is because it is assuming a frame has changed, even if a FITS keyword
was replaced with exactly the same value.

After a reset or init, QLT loses the subscription information from QLTs
and slave QLSs.

